{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>כי</b>, <b>ושמת</b>, <b>אל</b> — [verses] one through three, three joined portions." "<b>ללחום</b> — to eat bread." "<b>בין תבין</b> — root of עיין, and likewise: אבינה בבנים, that is, you will understand those who stand before you to enjoy the measure of food; and the vav of ושמת stands in place of או."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:16.441246884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}